      "standard": "W2.b",
      "type": "identify",
      "question_html": "For \\( f(x) = |2x - 8| - 6 \\): rewrite in the form \\( a|x - h| + k \\), state the parent function, identify <em>a</em>, <em>h</em>, <em>k</em>, and find the x-intercepts.",
      "inputs": [
